WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.975
Confucius Institute connections.

00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:10.237
University of Regina Confucius Institute was established in 2011 and has since scrubbed its web presence.

00:00:10.237 --> 00:00:16.150
CSIS identified Confucius Institutes as platforms for Chinese intelligence gathering.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:26.837
Vicky Bae took over the Queen's student union on the campus with help from the Confucius Institute and CCP, which maintains deep ties to Chinese state-aligned institutions.

00:00:26.837 --> 00:00:33.075
This creates an intelligence vector linking academic leadership to the Crown prosecution function.
